OnStop2FinishAndRemoveTask Timer

Derived from OnStop2FinishAndRemoveTask by takusan23.
Original project: https://github.com/takusan23/OnStop2FinishAndRemoveTask
Original license: Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Modifications in this repository add a configurable background task timer,
Portuguese settings, and system/user-installed app category filters.
Modified versions use a separate application ID and a separate signing key.
This is an unofficial derivative; no endorsement by the original author is implied.

Timer 3 modifications also add a Material 3 glass-inspired interface,
short UI animations, background package metadata loading, and atomic app selection writes.
